              "id": "HS-JAVASCRIPT-16",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "(1/1) * Possible vulnerability detected: Alert statements should not be used\nalert(...) as well as confirm(...) and prompt(...) can be useful for debugging during development, but in production mode this kind of pop-up could expose sensitive information to attackers, and should never be displayed. For more information checkout the CWE-489 (https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/489.html) advisory."
              },
